    rdfs:comment "Footer of the articles: \"Text is available under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 License\". Used to verify wording and speakers; some backs use an article's title, a film's title, and some casts are taken from its cast lists, which are facts; nothing of its own text copied."@en .

