    dcterms:creator "IMSDb" ;
    rdfs:comment "No license stated; the screenplays are the copyright of their owners. Used to verify wording; nothing of its own copied."@en .

<https://www.springfieldspringfield.co.uk/>
    dcterms:title "Springfield! Springfield!: subtitle transcripts of films" ;
    dcterms:creator "Springfield! Springfield!" ;
    rdfs:comment "No license stated; its terms (https://www.springfieldspringfield.co.uk/terms.php) make the transcripts available \"for research and educational purposes (including text mining, web mining, and data mining)\". Used to verify wording; nothing of its own copied."@en .

<https://www.moviemistakes.com/>
